WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:04.420
Every Jew today lives with an
old tradition and a modern world,

2
00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:05.860
both at once.

3
00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:09.020
Some questions face
everyone: what to keep,

4
00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:12.320
what to say, and whose teaching to follow.

5
00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:16.970
Over many centuries, Jewish teachers
have given very different answers.

6
00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:21.920
So what does living as a Jew mean today,
and whose voice can help answer that?

7
00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:24.700
In this mission, you'll
meet some of those teachers,

8
00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:29.050
from Hillel two thousand years
ago to a rabbi of our own time.

9
00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:34.130
Then you'll meet Jonathan Sacks,
Chief Rabbi from 1991 to 2013,

10
00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:35.920
and see what he taught.

11
00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:40.100
Your mission: find out what it
means to live as a Jew today,

12
00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:43.000
from what you wear to
how you answer hatred.
